&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 47.266666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;大&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 188px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; line-height: 1; text-align: left; text-indent: -18px"&gt;● 製造方法の技術革新による生産性向上で生産コスト減&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 82.27px"&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 37.466666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #DEEAF6"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;物理的リスク&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 37.8px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;急性&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 108.2px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt;異常気象の&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt;激甚化&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 194px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt;台風・竜巻・洪水によって起こる従業員・工場への被害、操業停止・生産減少・設備の復旧への追加投資&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 47.266666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;中&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 47.266666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;中&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 188px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;● 災害時のＢＣＰ対応強化&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;● 生産拠点の増強と分散&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;● 主要生産工場への浸水対策&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 89.6px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 37.8px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;慢性&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 108.2px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt;平均気温の上昇&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 194px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt;従業員の労働環境悪化、生産性低下、人材不足加速、健康リスク対応へのコスト増加&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 47.266666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;小&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 47.266666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;小&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 188px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; background-color: #FFFFFF"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; line-height: 1; text-align: left; text-indent: -18px"&gt;● 自社研究開発を進め、省人化施工の実現&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
